{"translation":{"id":"cmn_feb","name":"免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"FEB","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: 免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"281f45e9c6d64d9cf8e618e4fd7d2d961bebba0f46a534312de0f8ea52a83755","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7959,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_feb","name":"启示录","commonName":"启示录","title":"启示录","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"1b0315a3d5fb9bc58371677cd24bae3a1e83b3ad82faf7987ee2a56ef5c58c4d","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":405},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["当羔羊打开第七封印时，天堂里有大约半个小时的沉默。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我看见站在上帝面前的七位天使，被赐予七枝号角。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["另一位天使来到，站在祭坛前",{"noteId":33},"，手拿金香炉",{"noteId":34},"。他被赐予许多香，加入所有圣徒的祈祷之中，放在宝座前的金坛上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["香散发的烟和众圣徒的祈祷，从天使手中一同升到上帝面前。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["天使拿着香炉，用圣坛上的火把其填满，然后扔到大地；于是就有惊雷、闪电和可怕的地震。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["然后拿着七枝号角的七位天使，做好吹号的准备。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["第一位天使吹响他的号角，就有冰雹和混杂着血的火，投向大地。三分之一的大地被烧尽，三分之一的树被烧毁，所有的青草都被烧毁。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["第二位天使也吹响号角，一座仿佛燃烧的大山被扔进大海，三分之一的海变成血。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["海中三分之一造物死去，三分之一船只被毁。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["第三位天使吹响号角，一颗燃烧的巨大星辰从天上落下来，落入三分之一的江河和水的泉源之中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["这星名叫“苦堇。”三分之一的水变苦，",{"noteId":35},"因水变苦，许多人因为这水而被毒死。",{"noteId":36}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["第四位天使吹响号角，三分之一太阳、三分之一月亮、三分之一星辰都遭受到打击，于是三分之一的日月星都变黑，三分之一的白昼没有了光，夜晚也是如此。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["我看着，听见一只在天空中飞翔的鹰",{"noteId":37},"，大声说：“灾难！灾难！住在地上的人将迎来灾难！因为还有三位天使将要吹其他的号角。”"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":33,"caller":"+","text":"原意为“在上面。”","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":3}},{"noteId":34,"caller":"+","text":"用来盛香的物品。","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":3}},{"noteId":35,"caller":"+","text":"在希腊语中，“苦堇”是“苦”的同义词。","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":11}},{"noteId":36,"caller":"+","text":"这里使用了一个不同的词，“使其变苦或变酸”，但根据它带来的后果，最好将其翻译为“有毒。”","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":11}},{"noteId":37,"caller":"+","text":"或者秃鹫。","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_feb/REV/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/REV/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/REV/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}